  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Abuuu! No sé qué le pasa a mi Honedge...\nLo curé y todo, pero sigue igual de decaído.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm, ¡más claro, imposible, pequeñín! No temas.\nLo que le pasa es que necesita un buen afilado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué tengo que hacer?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E9002000740065006E0067006F0020007100750065002000680061006300650072003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Conozco un remedio infalible para devolverle\nel filo a Honedge, el Pokémon Espada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un Pupitar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006E002000500075007000690074006100720021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Un quéee?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0055006E00200071007500E900650065003F002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pupitar tiene una coraza durísima que impide\nque le hagan daño.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Es perfecta para afilar la cuchilla de Honedge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tú lo dices... Pero... ¿de dónde voy a sacar\na uno de esos Pupitar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah! ¡Oye! No tendrás un Pupitar por ahí, ¿no?\n¡Necesito que mi Honedge se enfrente a uno!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfréntate a mi Honedge con un Pupitar, porfa.\nY que sea el único Pokémon en tu equipo, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si Honedge ataca varias veces el duro cuerpo\nde Pupitar, ¡su filo quedará como nuevo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Trajiste un Pupitar! Deja que mi Honedge\ncombata contra él, porfaaa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400720061006A006900730074006500200075006E002000500075007000690074006100720021002000440065006A006100200071007500650020006D006900200048006F006E0065006400670065000A0063006F006D006200610074006100200063006F006E007400720061002000E9006C002C00200070006F00720066006100610061002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A ver ese filo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100200076006500720020006500730065002000660069006C006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No tengo ganas",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002000740065006E0067006F002000670061006E006100730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, bueno...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006200750065006E006F002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yupiii! ¡A combatir se ha dicho!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059007500700069006900690021002000A1004100200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200073006500200068006100200064006900630068006F002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Déjame que te cure, Honedge. ¡Lo hiciste\nmuy bien, aunque no hayamos podido ganar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hon, hon!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006E002C00200068006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eeeh? ¡Honedge volvió a ser el de siempre!\n¡Tenías razón, abu!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006500650068003F002000A10048006F006E006500640067006500200076006F006C0076006900F300200061002000730065007200200065006C0020006400650020007300690065006D0070007200650021000A00A100540065006E00ED00610073002000720061007A00F3006E002C0020006100620075002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Jo, jo, jo! Tu abuelo siempre tiene la razón...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004A006F002C0020006A006F002C0020006A006F002100200054007500200061006200750065006C006F0020007300690065006D0070007200650020007400690065006E00650020006C0061002000720061007A00F3006E002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nada que un buen Pupitar no pueda solucionar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006100640061002000710075006500200075006E0020006200750065006E002000500075007000690074006100720020006E006F00200070007500650064006100200073006F006C007500630069006F006E006100720021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y lo mejor de todo es que Pupitar también saca\nbeneficio de todo esto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poner a prueba la dureza de su coraza le ayuda\na relajarse hasta que esté listo para evolucionar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eso me huele a mentira...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073006F0020006D00650020006800750065006C0065002000610020006D0065006E0074006900720061002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, lo importante es que Honedge está\nmás animado, ¡y todo gracias a tu Pupitar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias a ti también por ayudarnos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200061002000740069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200070006F00720020006100790075006400610072006E006F0073002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Estoy seguro de que muchos Pokémon se ayudan\nentre sí, aunque nosotros no lo sepamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
